{"@context":"https://schema.org","@type":"Article","@id":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_45061","headline":"奉和崔中丞使君论李侍御萼登烂柯山宿石桥寺効小谢体 · 皎然","name":"奉和崔中丞使君论李侍御萼登烂柯山宿石桥寺効小谢体","inLanguage":"zh-Hans","text":"常爱谢公郡，幽期愿相从。\n果回青骢臆，共蹑玄仙踪。\n灵境若髣髴，烂柯思再逢。\n飞梁丹霞接，古局苍苔封。\n往想冥昧理，谁亲冰雪容。\n蕙楼耸空界，莲宇开中峰。\n昔化冲虚鹤，今藏护法龙。\n云窥香树沓，月见色天重。\n永夜寄岑寂，清言涤心胸。\n盛游千年後，书在岩中松。","author":{"@type":"Person","name":"皎然","nationality":"唐"},"publisher":{"@type":"Organization","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"image":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/og/open_45061.png","mainEntityOfPage":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_45061","isPartOf":{"@type":"WebSite","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"genre":"五言古诗","abstract":"收录于https://github.com/chinese-poetry/chinese-poetry"}